    "text": "UIII. IDUS. IANUARII. SERMO IN AEPIPHANIA DOMINI. \u00f0ES D\u00e6G IS gehaten on bocum\nSe \u00e6lmihtiga godes sunu. \u00fea \u00f0a he mann beon wolde. \u00f0a sende he his bydel toforan him IOHANNEM\nSe IOHANNES w\u00e6s acenned swa swa o\u00f0re menn beo\u00f0 of f\u00e6der and of meder. and w\u00e6s anfeald man.\n\u00de\u00e6t on wifa bearnum n\u00e6s nan m\u00e6rra mann. \u00feonne IOHANNES se fulluhtere;\nCrist n\u00e6s na of wife acenned. ac w\u00e6s of m\u00e6dene. for \u00f0i n\u00e6s he geteald to \u00f0yssere wi\u00f0metennysse;\nIohannes \u00f0a \u00f0a he gesti\u00f0od w\u00e6s \u00f0a wolde he forbugan \u00f0a un\u00f0eawas \u00fee menn bega\u00f0. and ferde \u00f0a to\nAc \u00e6t him ofet. and \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t he on wuda findan mihte;\nEall his reaf w\u00e6s geworht of oluendes h\u00e6re;\n\u00dea \u00f0a he ge\u00f0ogen w\u00e6s. \u00fea com him to godes bebod. \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde faran to mannum. and bodian\nOn \u00f0am fulluhte n\u00e6s nan synne forgifenyss;\nAnd he sceolde eac cy\u00f0an ymbe cristes fulluht. \u00fee toweard w\u00e6s on \u00f0am \u00f0e beo\u00f0 ealle synna\nIohannes com \u00f0a swa swa him beboden w\u00e6s to \u00f0\u00e6re ea \u00fee is gehaten Iordanis. and clypode to\nBehreowsia\u00f0 eowre synna. and wyrca\u00f0 d\u00e6dbote. for \u00f0an \u00fee godes rice geneal\u00e6h\u00f0;\n\u00c6lc treow \u00fee nele beran godne w\u00e6stm sceal beon forcoruen. and on fyre forb\u00e6rned;\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t andgit \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc man \u00fee nele wyrcan god weorc sceal beon mid dea\u00f0e forcoruen. and on\n\u00dea com \u00fe\u00e6t Iudeisce folc to Iohanne. and andetton him heora synna. and he hi fullode on \u00f0\u00e6re ea\n\u00d0a axodon hi Iohannem hw\u00e6t hi don sceoldon;\nHe andwyrde mid feawum wordum. and \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0;\nSe \u00f0e h\u00e6bbe twyfeald reaf. sylle \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0er \u00feam \u00f0e n\u00e6bbe;\nSe \u00f0e h\u00e6bbe twyfealde mettas. he do han